OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife and access boost planned
OL,4,Afor city park
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is due to start improving access
OL,7,Fand habitats for wildlife at a nature
OL,8,Fpark in Coventry.
OL,10,FLongford Nature Park is a small reserve
OL,11,Fwhich the city council has designated
OL,12,Fas being of high importance to the
OL,13,Fcity.
OL,15,FThe improvements will include a new
OL,16,Fboardwalk across muddy parts of the
OL,17,Fpark, litter-picking and the creation
OL,18,Fof shallow wetland habitats.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
